In an episode of Life with Felix that aired on 18 October 2026, fans speculated about why reality TV star and entrepreneur Tracy Hlophe was expected to apologise after her in-laws hinted that her past actions were unsavoury.

FANS SPECULATE WHY TRACY HLOPHE MUST APOLOGISE

When Nozipho Hlophe, Felix’s older sister, visited him at home, he opened up about the state of his marriage to Tracy.

He revealed that they were co-parenting since they were living apart and admitted he was lonely because of the distance between them.



The Gagasi FM breakfast host then lifted the lid on a deeper family issue: his two older siblings, Bhabha and Lulu, still haven’t forgiven Tracy for her past actions and would only reconcile with her after she apologised.

In an effort to move the family forward, Nozipho then heads to Lulu’s home to hear her side of the story.

Lulu explains that after speaking to their older brother, Bhabha, about Tracy wanting to take accountability for her actions, he suggested that they carry out a traditional ceremony where she could formally apologise to the Hlophe family, including their ancestors.



It was at this point that viewers started wondering what Tracy had actually done to warrant a whole traditional ceremony.

One theory that dominated X (formerly Twitter) was that Tracy may have cheated on Felix, especially after he hinted that the infidelity that she spoke about in Season 1 has been wrongly perceived as having come from him side.

